menu "Magnetic interaction demo"

config MAGNETIC_INTERACTION_USE_HARDWARE
    bool "Use calibrated BMM150 hardware input"
    default y
    help
        Read the two populated BMM150 sensors and use the ESP-Mosaico V1
        calibration profile. Disable this option to retain the touch-driven mock
        source for interaction, rotation, and orbit development. The calibrated
        hardware profile targets non-ferromagnetic desktop surfaces.

config MAGNETIC_INTERACTION_NETWORK_ID
    hex "Mosaico network ID"
    default 0x4D4F5341
    range 0x1 0xFFFFFFFF
    help
        Devices interact only with peers using the same network ID and radio
        channel. Use a different value for nearby independent assemblies.

config MAGNETIC_INTERACTION_ESPNOW_CHANNEL
    int "ESP-NOW radio channel"
    default 1
    range 1 14
    help
        Fixed primary channel used by every device in the assembly.

endmenu
